msgstr "Freagra earráide, m.sh. NXDOMAIN"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:89
msgid ""
"Evaluated top to bottom - the first policy a packet matches wins. Within one "
"policy the selectors are ANDed: source plus domain means only that client, "
"and only to those domains."
msgstr ""
"Déantar meastóireacht ó bharr go bun – is í an chéad bheartas a "
"mheaitseálann paicéad a bhíonn i réim. Laistigh de bheartas amháin, cuirtear "
"na roghnóirí i bhfeidhm trí oibríocht loighciúil AND: ciallaíonn 'foinse "
"móide fearann' an cliant sin amháin, agus na fearainn sin amháin."

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:172
msgid ""
"Everything arriving on these devices, ORed with the client selectors above - "
"a whole guest network or VLAN, in IPv4 and IPv6 alike, whatever prefix it "
"gets. Not the router's own traffic. For domains, add the device to the "
"observed devices as well."
msgstr ""
"Gach rud a shroicheann na gléasanna seo – i gcomhcheangal leis na roghnóirí "
"cliant thuas – bíodh sé ina líonra aíonna iomlán nó ina VLAN, in IPv4 agus "
"in IPv6 araon, is cuma cén réimír a fhaigheann sé. Ní chuimsítear trácht an "
"ródaire féin. I gcás fearann, cuir an gléas leis na gléasanna atá á "
"mbreathnú chomh maith."

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:53
